# TEFAS client and copy

- Call current `https://www.tefas.gov.tr/api/funds/...` JSON. The old `BindHistory*` API is retired — do not use it.
- Do not scrape HTML. Prefer a browser-like `User-Agent` on first implementation.
- Refresh **followed funds only**. Search is on demand. Respect that TEFAS is rate-limited and may serve Akamai challenges.
- Isolate all HTTP inside `TefasClient`. If the phone is blocked, swap this type only; `FundRepository` and UI stay.
- Tests must fake `TefasClient`. Never hit live TEFAS from unit tests.

`ExplanationMapper` is a pure map from official fields (type, risk, fees, and similar) to short Turkish sentences.

```kotlin
// ❌ BAD
"Bu fonu alın; düşük riskli ve getirisi yüksek."

// ✅ GOOD
"Fonun resmi türü hisse senedi fonu. Risk değeri TEFAS kaydındaki skorudur. Bu açıklama yatırım tavsiyesi değildir."
```

No buy/sell, no target price, no “size uygun”, no holdings/TL. If a field is missing, say so — do not invent it.
